window.products.push({"id":985195,"name":"ThyLove Pull Out Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinet, Heavy Duty Slide Out Seasoning Organizer for Kitchen Cabinets, Cabinet Seasoning Organizer for Uppe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dXjG-t3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Pull out Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinet】 Are you still worried about the messy seasoning bottles in the kitchen, or tired of not being able to find anything in a mess of jars and bottles? This slide out spices rack is the perfect solution for you to organize your kitchen cabinets and allows easy access to all your spices. Please MEASURE YOUR CABINET before ordering. If you are not sure if the spice rack fits your cabinet, we are always here to help! 【Mesh Design and Elevated Guardrail】 The Slide Out Seasoning Organizer has guardrails, preventing items from falling in the front row when you pick them up. The spice racks adopts a grid design. While bearing the weight, it can also prevent spice jars from tipping over. The shelf can safely place everything without any accidents 【Made to Last& Durable】 High quality iron Finish. As this kitchen cabinet roll out shelf is manufactured with a ball bearing system, the slide out will be smooth. A well-organized slide out spice rack adds more cabinet space and Full extension glides offer you easy complete access to all spices inside the kitchen upper cabinets 【Easy to Install Seasoning Organizer】The slide out spice organizer fits almost all cabinets. Installation is super easy and can be finished in minutes. Just 4 screws needed.Our space saving spice racks can complement your home storage system and improve your cabinet space usage 【Spice Racks Customer Satisfaction Guarantee】 We sincerely hope to provide customers with high-quality products and considerate service. If there is problem about installing the rack or any other trouble with your product no matter for what reason, please let us know and we will solve all your problems within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dXjG-t3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThyLove","source_asin":"B0B31NNTZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B31NNTZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B31NNTZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":985196,"name":"Kalawen Weather Station and Projection Alarm Clock Color Multifunctional Time Date Weekday Temperature Humidity LCD Display (Projection Clock)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CECPocmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏆Projection Alarm Clock Weather Station for Bedroom & 180°Adjustable Angle: the ceiling projection range is 0.5~3m, and the optimal projection distance is 1.5~3m. The projection angle can be adjusted by 180 degrees. Optional 12/24 hour mode. The projector components can be tilted so you can project the time onto the desired wall or ceiling. 🏆Multi-functional LCD Screen Display & Adjustable Brightness: you can view the time, date, weekday, indoor and outdoor temperature, humidity, weather forecast and other information to facilitate your daily life. Our projection clock with Indoor and outdoor temperat predicts weather trends based on outdoor temperature and humidity, making it easy for daily life, allowing you to choose the better clothes and decide whether or not to bring an umbrella.The brightness of the screen can be adjusted. 🏆Adjustable Brightness Ceiling Projected Time & Dual Alarm Clock: the brightness of the projected time can be adjusted according to your needs. Don't worry about the problem about the light being too bright when you sleep. You can set two separate alarm times, and the optional radio or buzzer will wake you up when you need it. The Snooze button lets you have 5 to 60 extra naps. 🏆Backup Battery Backup: DC power supply is used for alarm, time, weather and other display functions. The button battery included in projection alarm clock with is designed to ensure that all settings are remembered during a power outage, so you don't need to set it up again. (The button battery is not for the product to work.) 🏆Trustworthy Lifetime After-Sales Warranty: if you have any pre-sales or after-sales question, please feel free to contact us. If you’re not satisfied with this projection alarm clock , please don’t hesitate to contact us, we can provide immediately a replacement service or return service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CECPocmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalawen","source_asin":"B07MCHBRS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCHBRS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCHBRS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
