window.products.push({"id":985319,"name":"500cc (100 PCS – 5 Pcs Packs * 20 sets) Food Grade Oxygen Absorbers for Food Storage use for Vacuum Seal or Mylar Bag Food Storage Keep Food Fresh Ant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NZxECjLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶【EXTEND SHELF LIFE OF FOOD】: Since oxygen can shorten the shelf life of some foods. The purpose of our oxygen absorbers is to remove oxygen and moisture from sealed food containers and increase the shelf life of food. By reducing the amount of oxygen in the container, food can be preserved for up to 25 years or more! ▶【FDA FOOD GRADE QUALITY】: Our oxygen absorbers are designed to be 100% safe, reliable, and easy to use. This food grade product provides an oxygen-free environment for the food preservation process. It works instantly when placed in the packaging and keeps on working for a longer period of time without damaging the product. ▶【CONTAINS OXYGEN INDICATOR】: Each 5pcs pack includes one oxygen indicator in pink color. The indicator will change color from bright pink to a reddish hue when the oxygen content drops in the packaging, indicating that the absorbers are fresh! Use them with mylar bags, vacuum sealers, and mason jars for the best results! ▶【PACKAGE DETAILS】: Our oxygen absorbers come in 20 sets. Each pack contains 5 pieces that are vacuum sealed to prevent them from being exposed to air before they are opened, resulting in better preservation. Simply add a few packets of oxygen absorbers to your sealed food container and allow them to absorb all the oxygen inside. ▶【HIGH ABSORPTION RATE】: Removing oxygen from packaged food makes a HUGE difference when it comes to preserving the nutrient value and freshness of your food. This product is 10x more effective than vacuum sealing, so if you want to preserve grains, flour, dried fruits, meats, and vegetables longer than ever before - this is a must-add in your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NZxECjLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEXONIX","source_asin":"B0B7FTX9VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7FTX9VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7FTX9VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
