window.products.push({"id":985381,"name":"Tiny Ideas Holiday Santa and Me Keepsake Photo Frame, Perfect Christmas Seasonal Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tBuIqUz2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Capture the wonder of the holiday season with this Tiny Ideas White ‘Santa & Me’ Christmas Keepsake Photo Frame. You’ll never want to forget your child’s special meeting with Santa. Your baby’s wish list is all filled out and they get to share their Christmas dreams with Mr. Claus all by themselves. This is a moment you’ll want to cherish and the Tiny Ideas ‘Santa & Me’ Christmas Photo Frame is a perfect way to highlight the snapshot. This special holiday keepsake Christmas frame is sure to become an instant holiday classic in your home. This holiday photo frame also serves as a sentimental piece of holiday décor, and makes a lovely Christmas keepsake. The seasonal décor frame is crafted with sturdy fiberboard painted in white with red lettering that reads, \"Santa & Me.\" This Christmas frame also boasts a folding easel backing, making it simple to display on tables and shelves. Simply choose a place of honor in your home and your Christmas frame is ready for all to admire. It makes the perfect decorating addition to all your tree ornaments and other seasonal décor. The Tiny Ideas holiday photo frame isn't just for Christmas gift giving; it also makes a perfect gift for any baby shower, Grandma gift or birthday throughout the year. With this holiday frame, you're ready for a Christmas photo shoot as soon as December rolls around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tBuIqUz2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tiny ideas","source_asin":"B07HJTH6VR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJTH6VR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJTH6VR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
