window.products.push({"id":985392,"name":"5 Min Assembly Mesh Back Office Chair with Headrest- Folding Office Chair- Ergonomic Chair for Office & Home- Task/Executive/Office Chair with Wheels-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pJGYcoE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable Office Chair: Office furniture should be comfortable, practical and attractive. That is why this office chair from Office Factor is the perfect task chair for any office, home or home office. Its practical design ensures proper support and air circulation for greater comfort. Use as desk or computer chair. Easy To Assemble: This chair is extremely easy to assemble and requires no special tools. This is a DIY office chair with a headrest that needs minimal effort to assemble. Just take it out of the box and within five minutes, your desk chair is ready to use. Folding Office Chair: With a convenient folding design, this computer chair can be easily stored under a desk or a shelf. The back completely folds over from 90 degrees to lie flat on the seat at the press of a button. When open, the back tilts to allow you to lean back and take the pressure off your spine, increasing productivity at work. Mesh Back Chair: With a mesh back that offers proper support to the back, this office chair allows optimum circulation of air to avoid heat buildup and keep you cool. The seat is cushioned with molded foam which supports the thighs and back properly to avoid pressure spots and fatigue. The Perfect Office Chair: With a strong base, Office Factor office chair is designed to support weight up to 250 lbs. Stabilized with PU castors that glide easily on both wood and carpet, it won’t cause any damage to your flooring. It comes with our full satisfaction warranty so order yours with complete peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pJGYcoE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFFICE FACTOR","source_asin":"B07DPVLTJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DPVLTJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DPVLTJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
