window.products.push({"id":985537,"name":"Boxiki Kitchen Donut Pan for Baking - Set of 3, Non-Stick Silicone Molds for Baking, Easy to Clean Silicone Donut Molds for Oven Full Size Doughnuts, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nRYDo3QSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE VERSATILITY: These baking silicone molds can be used for so many different desserts. You can use them to make individual donuts, muffins, snack cakes, and breakfast items. It is also good for small frozen treats. One set includes 3 different color trays, each has 6 cavity silicone donut molds. The size of each tray is 10.24*7.09*0.79 inches (26*18*2 cm). NO MORE METAL RUSTING: Our Donut Pans are made from high quality 100% food grade silicone. It is microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. They are made to last a lifetime. No smell, unlike aluminum chemical coating pan, donut pan silicone molds don't need coating to keep non-stick. It is also the healthier option. FOLDABLE: The flexibility of silicone allows the pan to be folded without damage, and it simply unfolds back to its initial shape for use. Ideal for the whole family. This donut mold is firmer and more durable compared to normal ones. EASY TO CLEAN: You can put them into the dishwasher or hand-wash to clean. The silicone trays are non-stick and dough-type, nothing will get stuck in the cavities, and even if they will, you could use some warm water to clean easily. GREAT CUSTOMER SERVICE: This donut mold will quickly become your favorite no-risk purchase. This makes a very thoughtful and fun birthday present, holiday gift, or anniversary gift for anyone who loves fresh donuts! If you have any questions, don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nRYDo3QSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boxiki Kitchen","source_asin":"B08H4NYMQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4NYMQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4NYMQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":985538,"name":"Northwest Art Mall Sailing on Lake Shasta California Artwork by Paul B. Leighton, 11-Inch by 17-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A002lgw-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paul B. Leighton has been drawing or painting for most of his life. He is the creative director for a graphic design and web development firm, and has always been fascinated with the fine arts. During the last few years, that fascination led him to focus on painting with oils. He enjoys painting various subjects, but he is most interested in landscapes. His long-term goal is to continue to try to capture some of the wonder and natural beauty of oregon and the pacific northwest. Leighton has painted commissioned works for many clients, and his work has been shown at the high desert museum, the mirror pond gallery and art exhibits arround bend. Paul is an avid outdoor enthusiast and brings his love of the outdoors into all his creations. He has developed many styles of painting from his illustrations to amazing fine art with animals, scenes and special subjects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A002lgw-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B00856V4XS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00856V4XS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00856V4XS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
