window.products.push({"id":985567,"name":"MONE Wake-Up Light,Night Light Clock Alarm,Sleep Music Alarm Clock,Color Changing Night Light Alarm Clock,Digital Fabric Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NT7qsRVrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Night light function The half circle of the alarm clock is designed as a soft night light. The light can be switched to up to 7 colors, which can be selected according to your preference. White noise of sleep The alarm clock comes with a variety of White Noise, including the sounds of Brook/Campfire/Wave /White Noise Raindrops/Raindrops/Rainforest/Wind/Thunderstorm, which can be played during sleep to help you sleep better. Unique shape Circumstantial small alarm clock is compact and lovely, the screen of alarm clock display is hidden after knitted fabric, you can put it on bedside ark, won't take up too big space. Intimate Design When the alarm goes off, if you need to take another nap for a while, you can press the button at the bottom of the alarm clock. The alarm clock will stop and ring again 9 minutes later. Method of use Plug it in before using it, and set the time, alarm and color of the night light through seven function buttons. Power source type: Corded Electric","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NT7qsRVrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MONE","source_asin":"B08X659R24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X659R24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X659R24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":985568,"name":"DreamDNA American Made Shredded Plush Visco Elastic Memory Foam Pillow - King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jrt2AJuhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Memory foam's ability to reduce pressure points is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep. Now you can enjoy the benefits of an open cell visco elastic shredded memory foam pillow like the leading brand at a fraction of the cost. The classic ergonomic shape with unique adjustable shredded memory foam was engineered through a collaboration of doctors, chiropractors and sleep professionals to promote proper cervical alignment and support. This shredded memory foam pillow will add comfort and help increase the quality of sleep by reducing painful pressure points caused by flat pillows. The open cell shredded memory foam used in this pillow is specifically designed to enhance spinal alignment and also provides additional support in areas where your head, neck and shoulders may be dipping or sagging without proper support. The foam is also specially formulated to contour to your body’s temperature and will give you the extra comfort you need to get the best night's sleep possible when you replace your current ordinary pillow. Our pillows have also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are manufactured, fabricated and packaged in the U.S.A. meeting all EPA and CSPC standards being safe and free from harmful chemicals. PURGreen uses independent laboratory results to qualify products and ensure they are manufactured without the use of ozone-depleting substances such as Chlorofluorocarbons, Polybrominated Biphenyl Ether substances, Harmful Metals, Formaldehyde, Prohibited Phthalates or any other unsafe materials. PURGreen also implements baseline requirements such as conserving water, energy and other natural resources in the manufacturing processes established through internationally accepted ISO standards and procedures. There may be a new foam smell associated with your new pillow; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all PURGreen, EPA and CSPC standards. MADE IN THE USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jrt2AJuhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmericanMade Foam","source_asin":"B06WD6ML6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WD6ML6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WD6ML6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
