window.products.push({"id":985627,"name":"Silicone Coasters for Drinks - 6 Pack 4\" Drink Coasters for Aesthetic Room Decor - Goth Accessories for Kitchen Gadgets by COASTERFIELD (Cream)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817n4ljRGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[GOTHIC DECOR FOR HOME & KITCHEN] Inspired from mid century art, this silicone drink coaster set will blend in perfectly with your gothic room decor. A complementary to your coffee cup for the coffee table and gothic kitchen accessories for your kitchen decor. The gothic rose window pattern will give a medieval look to your home decor and these cute coasters will be ideal wine accessories for your dining table set. [4“ COASTER DESIGN WITH PRECISION DETAILS] 4\" diameter enables these cool coasters to fit your beer, whiskey, wine, champaign and cocktail glasses, coffee mugs, tea cups, tumblers and flasks. Ceaseless pattern design makes the coasters sturdy, yet light weight. Precision details and the soft touch finish of premium silicone material add to the quality. Ideal kitchen gifts for the kitchen table in your new home decor. [NO WATER RINGS AND SCRATCHES ON YOUR FURNITURE] Raised pattern design with edge rim provides room to catch condensation and spills from your cold drinks, keeping moisture and water rings off the table. Protection against scratches for your furniture, thanks to soft silicone material and smooth backside surface. Keep your wood, granite, glass, soapstone, sandstone, marble, stone and stainless steel table tops secure with Coasterfield. [SLIP RESISTANT AND SURFACE FRIENDLY SILICONE MATERIAL] Slip resistant backside ensures a nice grip, ensuring these coasters stay firmly in place on any surface, keeping your drinks from sliding around on your office desk. They hold your glasses securely in place, while they won't stick to them. These unique coasters also protect your wooden desk and night stands against heat from your hot tea cup or coffee mug. [MULTI PURPOSE USE AND EASY CLEANING] Solution for stuck jar lids or bottle caps, as anti skid mat for your cutting board or mixing bowl, heat resistant grips for holding hot pans and pots, spoon holder, table pad or to place any utensils on, placemat, trivet or even as key holder to protect surfaces from scratches. Cleaning is so easy, just wash them under the sink or throw into the dishwasher. These wine coasters will be a stylish addition to your wine glass set for gothic home decor clearance and will match your cool room accessories. Cute home décor accents for kitchen desk, dining room table, patio table and also a stylish addition to restaurant, pub or bar decor. Ideal goth items for office decor and perfect choice to go with tea accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817n4ljRGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COASTERFIELD","source_asin":"B09H4Z71PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H4Z71PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H4Z71PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
