window.products.push({"id":985702,"name":"Bamboo Bread Slicer with Crumb Tray - Premium Bread Slicer for Sourdough Bread, Whole Wheat Bread and Homemade Bread - Foldable Bread Cutter, 3 Differ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SYm71Rf9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy baking, enjoy the happiness brought by evenly sharing deliciousness. Features: 100% High-quality bamboo Natural eco-friendly material Durable & Easy to cleanCut bread with a bread slicer more safely Cut bread more easily Foldable & Easy to store Advantages: 1. Natural & Environmentally Friendly: We constructed this bread slicer with 100% natural high-quality, environmentally friendly, and durable bamboo. All-natural bamboo has a more comfortable feel than wood, easy to wipe down and clean. 2. 3 Different Thicknesses of Slice: Thanks to the clever and well-thought-out design, Our bamboo bread slicer can provide 3 different thicknesses of slice choice. Allows you to slice a whole loaf of bread into beautiful even slices. It makes bread slicing so easy, and enjoy the joy of cutting out perfect bread slices. 3. Tray Design: The tray at the bottom of the bread slicer can collect the crumbs that appear during the slicing process - the tabletop does not need to be clean. After you cut bread, it's also a great choice to transport fruit or slice bread just like a bread box. 4. Foldable Design: The bread slicer adopts a foldable design, you only need to pull back the side walls with the slicing guides and turn them downwards. After the whole bamboo bread slicer is folded flat to fit perfectly into the base, it can be easily stored in any corner without taking uptight kitchen space. WARM TIPS: Please keep it in a cool dry place, avoid stored in a damp place Professional after-sales service: Customers satisfaction is our top priority. If our products do not meet your expectations, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with free replacement and refund services within 30 days so that you can shop without worries. Package Include: 1 x Bamboo Bread Slicer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SYm71Rf9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunshin","source_asin":"B094MSJDKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-985702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094MSJDKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094MSJDKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
