window.products.push({"id":986000,"name":"Marchpower Cooling Blanket Queen Size for Hot Sleepers, Arc-Chill Cooling Blanket with Double-Sided Design, Japanese Cooling Fiber Absorbs Body Heat, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816Qkxh1ncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Enhanced Coolness Feeling All Night】Struggling to sleep in the heat and humidity? Say goodbye to hot and restless nights with Marchpower's cooling blanket! this cooling blanket is crafted with Japanese Arc-Chill technology (Q-MAX>0.5, while general blankets< 0.2). The cooling fiber expertly absorbs body heat, leaving you feeling cool all night long, reducing skin temperature by 35.6 to 42°F, this cool blanket is the perfect choice for those who prefer not to run their air conditioning all night！ ❄【Double-Sided Design】Marchpower's double-sided cooling blanket - a must-have for all-year-round comfort! Our cooling blankets for hot sleepers feature an Arc-Chill cooling material on one side for an extra smooth and cool feeling. This cooling summer blanket will help you achieve a more restful sleep by effectively regulating your body temperature. On the other side, 100% egyptian cotton ensures softness and comfort, making it an ideal choice for cooler spring and autumn temperatures. ❄【STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX & Skin-Friendly】Marchpower cooling blankets with OEKO-TEX are gentle on even the most sensitive skin, making them the perfect choice for your kids, toddlers and pets. Also the perfect solution for hot sleepers and those who suffer from night sweats. Our blanket features a cool side that wicks away moisture and replaces it with fresh. Say goodbye to sleepless nights and hello to a luxurious, refreshing slumber with Marchpower's cooling summer blanket. ❄【Easy-to-Care Machine Washable】The cooling blanket for summer is machine washable, Just toss the cool blanket into a laundry bag and wash it under 30℃/86℉ water. No fade, No bleaching, No iron, No dryer, hang in the shade. And the best part? Whether you're at home, in the car, on a train or a plane, this is the perfect companion to keep you feeling cool and refreshed. So why wait? Start enjoying a cool, comfortable night's sleep! ❄【Multiple Sizes and Colors】Marchpower cooling blanket comes in four sizes - Small blanket (51\"x 67\") is perfect for kids, pets, and travel. Twin size blanket (59\"x 79\") is ideal for single. Queen size blanket (79\" x 86\") is perfect for couples use. King size blanket (90\" x 108\") is ideal for family use. Our cooling blanket also makes for a great gift for your loved ones! Whether it's Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, or Christmas, it's a thoughtful gift for hot sleepers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816Qkxh1ncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marchpower","source_asin":"B0BNXKM64S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNXKM64S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNXKM64S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
